# Day 54

## Experiment Title

Monitoring and Managing Jenkins Build Processes


## Objective

To study build monitoring and management features available in Jenkins.


## Theory

Jenkins provides monitoring and management features that help developers observe build execution, pipeline activity, testing stages, and deployment processes. Build logs and status reports help identify errors and troubleshoot issues during software development.

Monitoring Jenkins workflows improves Continuous Integration efficiency and ensures that automated processes execute correctly.


## Requirements

Jenkins

Java Development Kit

GitHub Repository

Windows Operating System


## Procedure

Open the Jenkins dashboard.

Access the build history and pipeline execution details.

Monitor build status and execution stages.

Analyze build logs generated during workflow execution.

Identify successful and failed stages in the pipeline.

Verify the completion status of automated tasks.


## Output

Jenkins build processes were monitored successfully.

Build logs and execution details were displayed correctly.

Pipeline stages and workflow activity were verified successfully.


## Result

Successfully monitored and managed Jenkins build processes.
